      474.72,
      310.35,
      568.79
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 50 (Lot 1) allotments in total extent of about 0.0758Hectare of land in Preliminary Plan No. CO 8049 dated 25.07.2016prepared by the Colombo District Surveyor-Superintendenton behalf of the Surveyor General situated in the Village ofBambalapitiya Division No. 47, Bambalapitiya, within ColomboMunicipal Council Limit in the Grama Niladhari DivisionWellawatta North of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofThimbirigasyaya in Colombo District in the Western Province.",
