  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      345.12,
      562.4,
      475.19
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agent duly authorized inwriting, before me at Road Development Authority, LandDivision, 4th Floor, \"Maganeguma Mahamedura\", DenzilKobbekaduwa Mawatha, Koswatta, Battaramulla of the 09thSeptember 2016 at 9.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 02nd September2016, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for the acquisition of the saidland, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
